ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh245: OPEN_SHELL with SIX ADVANCED_FACEs in two spatially isolated groups: Group 1 (y~0) has reference edge R with TWO genuinely equidistant (0.6mm) candidates B/C on opposite sides, requiring BRepBuilderAPI_Sewing::FindCandidates' arrMinDist tie-break; Group 2 (y~100) has D/E/F at 0mm/0.01mm/0.011mm offsets forming a reciprocity-asymmetric chain (D's nearest is E, but E's own nearest is F, not D) exercising the recursive mutual-match walk */
